e model's performance on the provided data and labels.\n\n        Parameters:\n        X (array-like): Training data.\n        y (array-like): Target labels.\n\n        Returns:\n        float: Accuracy score.\n        \"\"\"\n        if self._data is None:\n            raise ValueError(\"Model has not been trained yet.\")\n        \n        # Use the NearestNeighbors class from scikit-learn for scoring\n        model = NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=self.n_neighbors)\n        model.fit(self._data, self._labels)\n        predictions = model.kneighbors(X, return_distance=False)\n        accuracy = np",
